WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.030 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  it has not been that long since netflix  officially revealed the production of a  series based on the popular video game  horizon zero dawn as can be taken from  the website of the canadian film union  directors guild of canada the netflix  series bears the official title horizon  2074 and will be shot in toronto also  featured on the site are the first crew  members including jack boehm who  previously assisted with the direction  of the boys and michelle brady who is  the creative director for the amazon  series the expanse moreover journalist  and insider jeff grubb revealed in his  podcast that horizon 2074 will not  recount the events of the two video  games rather it will follow the plot  after part two also there will be two  timelines one illustrating the story of  the main character aloy and the other  the downfall of human civilization a loy  story and the end of the world are  separated by about a thousand years that  leaves a lot of potential for an  extensive story that has not been told  in neither of the games yet still it's  questionable why exactly the year 2074  shall be the focus after all mankind was  already wiped out in the 2060s we hope  to have official news about horizon 2074  soon the release date has not been  confirmed for netflix yet  the release of indiana jones 5 is still  about a year away nevertheless the  farewell of two hollywood legends is  already approaching one is film composer  john williams who hinted at his  retirement in an interview with ap he  revealed he was currently working on  indiana jones 5 and would most likely  turn his back on composing for films  afterwards this means that one of the  biggest hollywood artists will be  leaving as the 90 year old john williams  has composed the soundtracks of  countless global hits these include the  well-known indiana jones films star wars  jurassic park harry potter and many  others however it seems that williams  does not want to stop working all  together he has already announced his  intention to keep on writing concert  music the other person to give up his  work is harrison ford who will reach the  age of 80 on july 13th officially he has  not declared the end of his career but  considering his age four's retirement is  certainly imminent as well his partner's  han solo has already been dropped and  there probably won't be another indiana  jones movie with him either the  foundation of more relaxing years would  thus be laid though we are still waiting  for an announcement from ford himself  indiana jones 5 is expected to be  released in theaters on june 30th 2023  in late may the obi-wan kenobi series  was released with great success on  disney plus star wars fans in particular  who enjoyed episodes 1-3 are likely to  find the series very appealing now some  fans are completely satisfied with this  one season and do not want the storyline  to be dragged on others however are  quite fond of the idea of a second  season lead actor ewan mcgregor also  appears to belong to the second group  even before the season finale he told  the british gq magazine in an interview  that he would be very happy if the  series were continued darth vader actor  hayden christensen shares the same  opinion as he would also be up for a  second season however he did confess in  an interview with radio times that the  series was originally intended to be a  standalone the crew of the series seems  to have a different opinion director  deborah chao for instance spoke to  entertainment tonight about the series  being complete and that there were no  plans to go further lucasfilm president  kathleen kennedy supports this view even  though she does not rule out the  possibility of carrying on with the  series if there were a very good reason  to do so thus the responsible parties  behind the camera do not look as  inspired as the main actors but the real  question is what would be the content of  such a second season how should obi-wan  develop further and which stories would  there be to tell about him the people in  charge should come up with a good answer  to all these questions a compromise  solution would be a spin-off about the  inquisitor riva who is played by moses  ingram rumor has it that this is already  in the works but an official  confirmation is still pending in any  case we are looking forward to seeing  how obi-wan's story will evolve and will  continue to keep you up to date  it was only recently that we reported on  the upcoming deadpool 3 and the  statements made by the two screenwriters  rhett reese and paul wernick they  expressed confidence regarding the third  installment even though not every single  joke may be approved by disney now the  two authors had a chance to talk in the  post-credit podcast where besides other  things the sony flop morbius was  mentioned based on what they said reece  and wernick haven't seen the movie at  all but given the amount of memes they  won't be able to avoid including a  morbius gag here and there they likewise  clarified that deadpool would also be an  integral part of the mcu in the future  although they remain silent on the exact  plans to bring it all together reece  also spoke of a so-called fish out of  water comedy in the case of deadpool 3.  this is a metaphor that in the world of  movies means that the protagonist is  plunged into a completely foreign world  a classic example of this would be a  typical country dweller who is suddenly  exposed to the big city life in the case  of deadpool we are talking more about a  crazy anti-hero who has to survive in a  world full of superheroes the union of  deadpool and the mcu certainly holds  some potential a first preview is  already provided by a video from disney  released in the summer of 2021 which  shows the mercenary together with korg  as they watch and comment on free guy in  typical youtube reaction manner it is  unfortunately not known yet when  deadpool 3 will hit theaters but a  release prior to the end of 2023 is  considered highly unlikely  there is hardly any action film series  that enjoys such a cult status as james  bond the british spy who was created by  author ian fleming in as early as 1953  has been part of movie history since  1962. now ever since no time to die it  has been made clear that daniel craig  will no longer be taking on the role of  the double o agent producer barbara  brockley disclosed the current status of  the now 26th bond film in an interview  with deadline according to her the  filming of a new movie alone would take  place in two years at the earliest which  is nothing particularly unusual for the  film series since there is still plenty  of time before shooting begins they have  not even started to look for a successor  to craig just yet as it is many signs  suggest a reimagining of the james bond  character and a new approach in the  upcoming film indeed many fans hope that  the cult figure will not fall victim to  a total makeover for instance no time to  die already toyed with the idea that at  least the agent number 007 will be  filled by lashana lynch in the future  who in some form can also be given a  spin-off film what direction do you  think the bond franchise will continue  to evolve in and what are your  expectations for the 26th bond film feel  free to let us know in the comments  sony pictures achieved significant  success among both critics and fans last  year with ghostbusters afterlife the new  installment impressed especially those  who already like the original from 1984.  now a sequel seems to be in the works  which might be released in the near  future as the official ghostbusters  twitter channel confirmed they plan to  release the sequel already in december  2023. this is ambitious after all the  competition before christmas is  traditionally quite high the new star  trek movie will also be released during  this time for example like already  hinted upon at the end of the first part  the movie is set in manhattan and the  old familiar firehouse from the initial  ghostbusters director jason reitman who  by the way is the son of the original  director ivan reitman already shared  some details regarding the sequel with  the hollywood reporter accordingly the  sequel will follow the end of  ghostbusters afterlife which the ecto-1  enters manhattan and thus returns to its  home meanwhile work is also in progress  on an animated ghostbusters movie which  will be directed by hotel transylvania 4  film director jennifer kluska and motor  city creator chris prynoski jason  reitman also joins the netflix exclusive  series as an executive producer sadly  the series plot as well as the release  date are still unknown  those were the news for this week if you  haven't had enough yet check out our  latest original video on mission  impossible 7 to find out everything  there is to know about the new part of  the action series starring tom cruise  [Music]

